  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Alma2 ordains priests and elders by laying on his hands, Alma 6:1. Alma2 claps his hands upon those with him, and they are filled with the Holy Ghost, Alma 31:36. Christ gives disciples the Holy Ghost by laying on of hands, 3 Ne. 18:36–37. believers shall lay hands on sick, and they shall recover, Morm. 9:24. disciples given power to bestow the Holy Ghost by laying on of hands, Moro. 2:2. disciples ordain priests and teachers by laying on of hands, Moro. 3:1–2.",
